Project overview
This program reads a social network dataset (users.txt), then:
    a) Sorts users by number of posts using Bubble Sort and Merge Sort.
    b) Sorts each user’s friend list by the friends’ number of posts using Bubble Sort and Merge Sort
    c) Measures and records per-user runtimes (in nanoseconds) for sorting friend lists with both algorithms.
    d) plots the runtimes for extra credit.
